        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Escape the Maze – About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the Maze is an online co-op experience that combines tension and fun, as you and your friends try to escape terrifying mazes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a giant labyrinth filled with dark tunnels, unexpected traps, and lurking enemies, the only way out is to work together. But be careful—every word you shout in a panic can attract a creature that can hear you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔊 Experience Real Horror and Fun with Friends</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op gameplay: Try to escape the maze in teams of 2-3.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat: Use your voice wisely—whisper, shout, don't attract attention!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun horror atmosphere: Even when you're scared, moments that make you laugh await.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/216124868c3fc303cae479931b5fc412.poster.avif?t=1761535394\" width=764 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/216124868c3fc303cae479931b5fc412.webm?t=1761535394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/216124868c3fc303cae479931b5fc412.mp4?t=1761535394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>👹 Danger Is Everywhere</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart enemies hear you in the maze, follow you, and scare you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is filled with different dangers, traps, and hidden rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events create a unique experience every playthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/ca6650ef18e340f3ab135beb09797cef.poster.avif?t=1761535394\" width=760 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/ca6650ef18e340f3ab135beb09797cef.webm?t=1761535394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/ca6650ef18e340f3ab135beb09797cef.mp4?t=1761535394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧠 Puzzles and Survival</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just running isn't enough—some doors require cleverness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate, find keys, solve puzzles, and find the exit together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panic tests your strategy as you race against time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/10f7923064f855e800b9fd0e2ce63ee6.poster.avif?t=1761535394\" width=796 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/10f7923064f855e800b9fd0e2ce63ee6.webm?t=1761535394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/10f7923064f855e800b9fd0e2ce63ee6.mp4?t=1761535394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Escape the Maze – About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the Maze is an online co-op experience that combines tension and fun, as you and your friends try to escape terrifying mazes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a giant labyrinth filled with dark tunnels, unexpected traps, and lurking enemies, the only way out is to work together. But be careful—every word you shout in a panic can attract a creature that can hear you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔊 Experience Real Horror and Fun with Friends</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op gameplay: Try to escape the maze in teams of 2-3.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat: Use your voice wisely—whisper, shout, don't attract attention!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun horror atmosphere: Even when you're scared, moments that make you laugh await.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/216124868c3fc303cae479931b5fc412.poster.avif?t=1761535394\" width=764 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/216124868c3fc303cae479931b5fc412.webm?t=1761535394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/216124868c3fc303cae479931b5fc412.mp4?t=1761535394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>👹 Danger Is Everywhere</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart enemies hear you in the maze, follow you, and scare you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is filled with different dangers, traps, and hidden rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events create a unique experience every playthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/ca6650ef18e340f3ab135beb09797cef.poster.avif?t=1761535394\" width=760 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/ca6650ef18e340f3ab135beb09797cef.webm?t=1761535394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/ca6650ef18e340f3ab135beb09797cef.mp4?t=1761535394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧠 Puzzles and Survival</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just running isn't enough—some doors require cleverness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate, find keys, solve puzzles, and find the exit together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panic tests your strategy as you race against time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/10f7923064f855e800b9fd0e2ce63ee6.poster.avif?t=1761535394\" width=796 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/10f7923064f855e800b9fd0e2ce63ee6.webm?t=1761535394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944810/extras/10f7923064f855e800b9fd0e2ce63ee6.mp4?t=1761535394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
